                \:
                %em An Introduction to Quantum Representations of Mapping Class Groups
                (2024) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://tqft.math.tecnico.ulisboa.pt/seminars?id=7134"}> tqf.math.technico.ulisboa.pt:7134
                \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Proof that the values of a modular functor at
